FSCHRHUNT █
PROJECT: www

///

STATUS: PERSONAL

///

OVERVIEW:
 - Things I make, notes I leave, and a way to say hello.
 - Originally called blog. Renamed before the first post.
 - The scope has since expanded to include a second font.

///

REQUIRES:
 - Node.js 22 or newer and npm.
 - No environment variables. A rare opportunity to just run the thing.

///

START:
 npm ci
 npm run dev

 http://localhost:3000

///

CONTENTS:
 src/app/page.tsx              a brief introduction
 src/app/products/             e, Flip, and Diffuse
 src/app/notes/                evidence of a thought
 src/app/contact/              a conversation before the email
 src/app/globals.css           where the gaps are negotiated
 public/portrait.png           me, approximately

 Product dates are repository creation dates, not release dates.
 Flip's demo is an illustration. Diffuse's source is private.
 Contact prepares an email draft. You still have to send it.

///

MAINTENANCE:
 npm run lint
 npm run build
 npm run typecheck
 npm start

 Next.js, React, TypeScript. Inter is hosted locally; its license lives
 in src/app/fonts/OFL.txt. Motion respects reduced-motion preferences.

 To regenerate the transparent portrait icons:
 node scripts/generate-favicons.mjs

 Light and dark browser themes get separate PNGs. Safari gets its own
 pinned-tab mask. Native Safari's live theme switching is still unverified.
 There is, unfortunately, a browser-specific paragraph in this README.

///

FUTURE WORK:
 docs/README.md                a map of the moving parts
 AGENTS.md                     instructions for agents working here
 .agents/site.md               taste, subject to further taste
 .agents/skills/               writing, design, and review
 .agents/prompts/              somewhere to start

 Pages can have their own art direction. The homepage is not a zoning law.

///

DEPLOY:
 Vercel, Next.js preset, production branch main.
 Connect the Git repository and configure public access in Vercel.
 A merged PR is not a deployment until that wiring exists.

///

A NOD TO:
 https://shedsgns.me/

 For the design inspiration. The indecision is mine.

